.SH NAME
lmm-game-show-default - Show the current default game


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlmm game show-default [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Display the currently configured default game, or a note that none is
set.

.PP
Examples:
  lmm game show-default


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for show-default


